 "text": "Hello, how are things going? There' no magic bullet, but a few things help a lot. Keep food out of bags and away from the ground. Some people swear by them. They release a weak citrus smell that some bugs don't like. They' cheap, so it can't hurt to try. Then consider hanging a few yellow sticky traps. Wasps, flies and ants are drawn to them and get stuck. Small bottles are much better anyway. People touch big jugs and contaminate them.",
